:: OC Noah Vibrator Math 1 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> decides to give you all a mock exam as preparation for an upcoming test. This leads to the expected chorus of moans and groans from the students that quickly hush once Randolph glares at them. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I know you don’t like it, but complaining gets you nowhere.”</span> Randolph says as he passes out the exams, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you’ve been applying yourself, it’ll be easy. If not – well, you should be happy for this chance to see where you need to improve. This won’t affect your grade, but I’ll assign homework based on how well you do, so you can practice where you’re struggling.”</span> Another round of groans. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",

            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You nibble on the end of your pencil as you examine the first question. <span style="color:Yellow">It isn’t that hard, structure wise, but it is still more than a little tricky. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> sure isn’t pulling any punches with this!</span> As you begin to work towards the answer, your eyes flicker towards your classmate <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>. He fidgets a little, though seems to be concentrating very hard. He appears to have already passed by the first few questions. He must be trying very hard. <span style="color:Pink">It would be a shame if something were to distract him. You finger the remote in your bag idly as you ponder if you should do it.</span> <br>
<br>


<div id="choice">
    <<link "Leave Noah be<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        But you then release the remote. It would be pretty mean to mess with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> here, even if he’d probably like the idea. Best outcome would him getting an earful from Randolph and the worst would be him getting a spanking and the vibrator being discovered. Plus, you should really focus on your own test. <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "OC Noah",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Uniform",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        So, you move your hand away from your bag and focus on just getting your work done. <span style="color:Pink">Still, you do glance towards <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> every few minutes, imagining what sort of reaction he’d have if you did turn it on in the near silence of the classroom.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include"Attend Math Finish">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Give him a tease<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">You smile as you tap the device, turning it on just enough to give him a tease. You instantly see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> straighten up and make a noise of surprise. His fingers twitch as the vibration pulses inside his rear. You chuckle quietly as the sight as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> turns towards you slowly with a worried expression.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Blush: 3,
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "OC Noah",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Uniform",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 3,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Eyes front!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> calls out, causing both you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> to snap back to your exams. <span style="color:Pink">You can’t risk reaching back for the remote with the teacher’s eyes on you, so you figure <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> will just have to finish the rest of the test with the little tease going off in his ass. You wonder if this will affect his test scores.</span> <br>
        <<socialChange "NoahH" 3 1>>
        <br>
        <<include"Attend Math Finish">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Turn it on high<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">With a devious smirk, you decide to give <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> a reason to second-guess giving you as much control as he did, pressing the remote’s screen to turn the vibrator instantly to full blast for a few seconds! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> instantly yelps, nearly leaping out of his chair, slamming his knees on the desk, and falling to the ground in a heap, gripping both his crotch and his knees. For better or worse, he manages to resist orgasming in the middle of class until the vibrator turns off.</span> <br>

