        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hartford</span>!”</span> Randolph yells, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Stop goofing around and return to your test unless you want to spend afterschool detention retaking it with a reddened rear!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry! Leg cramp…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> says, turning red and quickly returning to his seat as a few people around him chuckle. <span style="color:Pink">Despite getting him into trouble, you can’t help but notice a tiny smile on his face.</span> <br>
        <<socialChange "NoahH" 3 1>>
